  "principles": [
    "Automatic loot and Spiritual Extraction are separate systems.",
    "Automatic loot is incidental/superficial/stolen; Extraction is specialized anatomy.",
    "No automatic loot item may duplicate an Extraction item from the same species.",
    "Automatic loot used by equipment must remain optional because stones/contribution acquisition paths stay valid.",
    "Equipment stats and power budgets are not changed by this contract.",
    "Unique encounters do not use this recurrent automatic-loot table.",
    "Boss rewards remain designed victory rewards, not recurrent RNG.",
    "Rare consumable drops are never mandatory equipment ingredients."
  ],
